{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13109140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13109140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1310914001:1":{"text":"어라, 이건 어떤 수도사의 노트죠? 여기에 몇 페이지가 떨어져 있어요...","source_cn":"咦，这是哪位修士的笔记？怎么会有几页掉在这里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x427AFBCD8437942A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310914002:1":{"text":"...아, 정말 조심성 없는 형제로군요.","source_cn":"……啊，真是位粗心的兄弟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57E91C798EB3C55A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310914003:1":{"text":"“아침 네 시 반에 일어나서 다섯 시에 아침 기도를...”\n와, 수도사는 정말 고생스럽네요. 이렇게나 이른 시간에 일어나야 한다니요!","source_cn":"“早上四点三十分起床，五点晨祷……”\\n哇，修士可真辛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x014DF034EA2BD494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310914004:1":{"text":"“순무 수프는 너무 짜고, 콩은 너무 싱겁게 삶아졌다...”\n수도원분들은 음식을 싱겁게 드시나 보네요.","source_cn":"“芜菁浓汤过咸，煮豆子又太淡……”\\n看来修道院的人吃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C909102D1376C70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310914005:1":{"text":"“...대주교 각하께서 소예배당 내에 새로운 구역의 두 분의 주교를 임명하신다고 했다... 드디어 대주교 각하를 알현할 수 있게 되었다...”","source_cn":"“……大主教阁下将在小礼拜堂内任命两位新的领区主教……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5F04D7BF007AE66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310914006:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여, 이 형제는 저처럼 신실하고 충성스럽군요.","source_cn":"艾雅在上，这位兄弟与我一样虔诚忠实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93F2A3C312F3E29D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士杨凯维奇":{"text":"수도사 캘러헨","source":"修士杨凯维奇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}